WEBVTT

00:01:34.100 --> 00:01:35.370
ONE YEAR LATER...

00:01:36.710 --> 00:01:39.760
How time flies. Your wedding
is next week already.

00:01:40.010 --> 00:01:44.900
Yes. We just went to pay
our respect to Soichiro.

00:01:47.380 --> 00:01:50.290
Godai, please be
good to Kyoko.

00:01:50.510 --> 00:01:51.100
Yes.

00:01:54.680 --> 00:01:57.740
She might have to
rough it in the beginning.

00:01:59.490 --> 00:02:03.790
It's better to live frugally
in the beginning.

00:02:05.290 --> 00:02:06.880
Good. Good.

00:02:08.410 --> 00:02:09.290
Now..

00:02:11.570 --> 00:02:15.100
Soichiro can
rest in peace.

00:02:30.560 --> 00:02:31.570
What?

00:02:31.790 --> 00:02:34.480
You're going to keep living
in the manager's quarters?

00:02:34.700 --> 00:02:37.760
Yes. Moving isn't cheap,

00:02:37.890 --> 00:02:40.820
and Soichiro's father said
we can stay.

00:02:41.230 --> 00:02:42.420
So for a while.

00:02:42.510 --> 00:02:43.890
You're gonna milk it.

00:02:44.230 --> 00:02:45.660
We can't afford luxury.

00:02:47.780 --> 00:02:50.070
Let's see...
What else can I burn?

00:02:53.850 --> 00:02:55.860
No sign of bliss
in this bride-to-be.

00:02:56.260 --> 00:02:58.280
This is her
second time, after all.

00:02:59.110 --> 00:03:00.630
I don't need this.

00:03:11.160 --> 00:03:12.140
What?

00:03:12.230 --> 00:03:14.290
N-Nothing.

00:03:16.830 --> 00:03:19.100
Kyoko? Here's some more.

00:03:19.230 --> 00:03:19.820
Yes.

00:03:28.950 --> 00:03:29.920
Manager?

00:03:31.320 --> 00:03:31.970
Yes?

00:03:32.350 --> 00:03:34.690
Is this a photo from
your first wedding?

00:03:35.080 --> 00:03:35.700
May I see?

00:03:36.920 --> 00:03:38.820
Akemi, how dare you
help yourself

00:03:38.890 --> 00:03:40.560
to someone else's property!

00:03:41.030 --> 00:03:41.950
Let me see.

00:03:44.290 --> 00:03:47.160
Now, there's a blissful bride!

00:03:50.380 --> 00:03:53.130
Look, Godai!
Manager looks so beautiful

00:03:53.480 --> 00:03:56.440
You don't want to
see that, do you?

00:03:56.570 --> 00:03:57.410
I don't mind.

00:03:57.850 --> 00:03:58.570
But.

00:04:01.640 --> 00:04:06.040
This is the first time I'm
seeing a photo of Soichiro.

00:04:07.790 --> 00:04:09.410
He looks like a nice man.

00:04:09.890 --> 00:04:10.760
Y-Yes.

00:04:12.320 --> 00:04:13.350
I'm sorry.

00:04:16.390 --> 00:04:18.080
She didn't
need to apologize.

00:04:47.430 --> 00:04:53.150
I'm sorry, Soichiro. I can't keep
these here anymore.

00:04:55.630 --> 00:04:58.390
I can't let
a wedding photo bother me.

00:04:59.750 --> 00:05:03.260
It's nothing new to me...

00:05:07.140 --> 00:05:09.810
I'm sure Kyoko is
emotionally ready.

00:05:30.700 --> 00:05:31.430
Kyoko?

00:05:32.750 --> 00:05:33.720
What's the matter?

00:05:33.810 --> 00:05:35.020
N-Nothing.

00:05:38.970 --> 00:05:41.570
Are those...Soichiro's?

00:05:49.950 --> 00:05:54.050
I'll return these to
Soichiro's father tomorrow.

00:05:54.460 --> 00:05:55.300
You seem..

00:05:56.890 --> 00:05:57.990
heartbroken.

00:05:58.240 --> 00:06:00.630
No! It's not that
I can't let go.

00:06:02.130 --> 00:06:05.870
I'm sorry. I should have
returned these a long time ago.

00:06:06.310 --> 00:06:07.860
You can keep them.

00:06:08.250 --> 00:06:09.030
I can't

00:06:10.620 --> 00:06:12.740
I have to close
that chapter of my life.

00:06:16.320 --> 00:06:19.900
What's wrong, Godai?

00:06:20.220 --> 00:06:25.280
You seem depressed. Did you
get into a fight with Manager?

00:06:25.560 --> 00:06:26.530
No.

00:06:27.020 --> 00:06:30.710
If you're like this now,
I don't know about your future.

00:06:30.800 --> 00:06:31.840
We're not in a fight!

00:06:33.510 --> 00:06:37.570
I see. I'm going to watch
an "Urusei Yatsura" video.

00:06:38.970 --> 00:06:41.960
Our future...

00:07:04.830 --> 00:07:06.260
That was delicious!

00:07:07.310 --> 00:07:08.090
Would you like more?

00:07:08.830 --> 00:07:10.500
No, I better get going.

00:07:11.470 --> 00:07:12.260
See you.

00:07:13.070 --> 00:07:14.170
I-I...

00:07:14.810 --> 00:07:15.320
Yes?

00:07:16.010 --> 00:07:19.700
I'm going to the Otonashi's
house today.

00:07:40.570 --> 00:07:45.760
I better go tell Soichiro
that I'm returning his things.

00:08:12.070 --> 00:08:12.930
Godai?

00:08:14.400 --> 00:08:15.670
What is he doing here?

00:08:35.250 --> 00:08:38.840
To tell you the truth,
I'm jealous of you.

00:08:39.720 --> 00:08:41.480
Even after she
returns your things,

00:08:41.720 --> 00:08:46.060
she's never going
to forget you.

00:08:49.500 --> 00:08:53.120
It's not about
forgetting you.

00:08:55.680 --> 00:08:58.960
You have a special place
in her heart.

00:09:03.020 --> 00:09:05.680
But I'm going to do my best.

00:09:06.930 --> 00:09:11.220
You were already a part of her
when I first met her.

00:09:12.490 --> 00:09:14.950
And that's the Kyoko
I fell in love with.

00:09:16.640 --> 00:09:17.570
And so...

00:09:18.730 --> 00:09:21.750
I'm going to have her,
along with you.

00:09:29.600 --> 00:09:30.860
Soichiro...

00:09:32.520 --> 00:09:36.280
I hope you're happy for me
that I met this man.

00:09:51.090 --> 00:09:51.740
Kyoko?

00:09:52.730 --> 00:09:53.850
What are you doing here?

00:09:54.070 --> 00:09:55.050
What about you?

00:09:56.410 --> 00:09:57.390
Don't you have to be
at the preschool?

00:09:57.780 --> 00:10:00.770
I got permission to leave
during my lunch break.

00:10:02.470 --> 00:10:03.830
When did you get here?

00:10:20.530 --> 00:10:21.650
Soichiro.

00:10:23.330 --> 00:10:27.730
I'm about to return
your belongings to your father.

00:10:27.960 --> 00:10:31.220
Kyoko, you don't
have to return them.

00:10:32.730 --> 00:10:33.530
No.

00:10:34.680 --> 00:10:35.720
This is how I want it to be.

00:10:40.740 --> 00:10:41.680
I...

00:10:51.720 --> 00:10:54.290
I'm so glad that I met you.

00:11:07.410 --> 00:11:10.400
Good-bye, Soichiro.

00:11:35.830 --> 00:11:37.590
Come on, Grandpa! Hurry!

00:11:37.650 --> 00:11:39.710
There's no need to rush.

00:11:39.800 --> 00:11:40.920
Hurry!

00:11:41.520 --> 00:11:42.790
Hi Ikuko!

00:11:42.860 --> 00:11:43.800
Hello!

00:11:44.170 --> 00:11:45.990
I hardly recognized you.

00:11:46.130 --> 00:11:48.330
Congratulations.

00:11:49.100 --> 00:11:50.650
Thank you.

00:11:51.230 --> 00:11:53.600
Dear, it's Soichiro's father.

00:11:53.870 --> 00:11:54.760
Ikuko!

00:11:56.400 --> 00:11:57.800
It's been so long!

00:11:57.870 --> 00:12:00.860
It sure has.
You've become so beautiful

00:12:00.950 --> 00:12:04.470
Oh, Auntie.
Is that you, Kentaro?

00:12:06.420 --> 00:12:08.040
You haven't changed.

00:12:08.120 --> 00:12:10.110
He hasn't grown.

00:12:10.460 --> 00:12:12.790
I'm your son, that's why!

00:12:14.150 --> 00:12:16.380
Is Auntie Kyoko ready?

00:12:16.470 --> 00:12:17.750
She's getting ready.

00:12:18.040 --> 00:12:19.300
What about Uncle Godai?

00:12:19.540 --> 00:12:21.360
He's a nervous wreck.

00:12:22.840 --> 00:12:25.260
Yusaku, stay still

00:12:27.950 --> 00:12:29.370
You're a fine groom.

00:12:30.140 --> 00:12:31.600
Hey! How are ya?!

00:12:31.680 --> 00:12:34.840
Sakamoto! You're too early
for the reception.

00:12:35.820 --> 00:12:37.810
I lied about the time and
cut out of work early.

00:12:38.060 --> 00:12:39.420
You haven't changed.

00:12:39.590 --> 00:12:43.010
Shucks. I had a crush
on the manager.

00:12:44.090 --> 00:12:45.470
Green with envy, aren't you?

00:12:45.890 --> 00:12:47.950
Auntie Kyoko is ready.

00:12:48.860 --> 00:12:50.330
I'm gonna go look.

00:12:52.070 --> 00:12:52.650
Me, too.

00:12:52.730 --> 00:12:53.930
Yusaku!

00:12:54.600 --> 00:12:56.430
It's your uncle
from Yokosuka.

00:12:56.540 --> 00:12:58.120
Congratulations, Yusaku.

00:12:58.680 --> 00:12:59.630
Thank you very much.

00:13:00.810 --> 00:13:03.430
I remember when you
were this little.

00:13:03.740 --> 00:13:05.840
CHIGUSA FAMILY

00:13:30.860 --> 00:13:33.380
Dad, Mom..

00:13:37.900 --> 00:13:40.990
I'm going to be happy.

00:13:41.610 --> 00:13:45.230
I'm not worried.
I know you will be.

00:13:47.320 --> 00:13:49.000
Dad, do you have
a few words for her?

00:13:52.120 --> 00:13:53.060
I guess not.

00:13:53.650 --> 00:13:55.210
Come, Grandpa!

00:13:57.990 --> 00:13:59.850
You're so beautiful, Kyoko.

00:14:00.360 --> 00:14:01.150
Father.

00:14:05.630 --> 00:14:09.150
Thank you for being so good
to me all these years.

00:14:11.550 --> 00:14:14.070
I was waiting for a day
like this to arrive.

00:14:21.430 --> 00:14:23.850
I wish you great happiness,

00:14:24.380 --> 00:14:26.220
to make up for what
you've been through.

00:14:26.830 --> 00:14:30.510
You were destined
for this day.

00:14:32.130 --> 00:14:32.990
Kyoko.

00:14:37.540 --> 00:14:38.830
Father.

00:14:43.870 --> 00:14:46.470
Don't let your makeup run.

00:15:38.070 --> 00:15:40.890
CLOSED FOR PRIVATE PARTY

00:15:48.270 --> 00:15:49.540
We don't have enough seats.

00:15:50.050 --> 00:15:52.000
We're here, Master!

00:15:52.240 --> 00:15:54.260
Good to have you back, Akemi.

00:15:54.350 --> 00:15:58.680
Let's welcome the
new bride and groom!

00:15:59.220 --> 00:16:00.260
Congratulations!

00:16:02.980 --> 00:16:04.080
Congratulations!

00:16:06.890 --> 00:16:07.980
We're so happy for you!

00:16:08.700 --> 00:16:10.240
Chief!

00:16:10.330 --> 00:16:12.690
You're all here!
Thank you!

00:16:12.860 --> 00:16:15.120
Let's toast!

00:16:15.400 --> 00:16:16.860
- Beer!
- Squeeze in, everyone!

00:16:16.940 --> 00:16:18.200
Someone, put some
newspapers on the floor!

00:16:18.580 --> 00:16:19.440
Huh?

00:16:19.500 --> 00:16:21.440
Sorry we're late.

00:16:22.580 --> 00:16:25.130
We're just getting
started, Mitaka.

00:16:25.510 --> 00:16:28.370
We had to stop
at the hospital.

00:16:28.510 --> 00:16:29.540
Hospital?!

00:16:30.010 --> 00:16:31.450
Are you all right?

00:16:32.320 --> 00:16:33.100
Oh, yes.

00:16:34.010 --> 00:16:36.710
Don't be shy. Come on in.

00:16:44.800 --> 00:16:45.880
This is why.

00:16:47.260 --> 00:16:49.100
She's huge.

00:16:49.170 --> 00:16:51.150
Must be twins.

00:16:52.630 --> 00:16:54.650
Congratulations, Mitaka.

00:16:55.450 --> 00:16:59.270
Please.
Congratulations to you.

00:16:59.470 --> 00:17:00.810
Congratulations.

00:17:01.250 --> 00:17:02.460
Thank you.

00:17:03.820 --> 00:17:05.140
You look very happy.

00:17:05.650 --> 00:17:07.280
Yes, and so do you.

00:17:09.560 --> 00:17:10.990
- Godai..
- Yes?

00:17:12.920 --> 00:17:14.050
I wish you the best.

00:17:14.730 --> 00:17:15.280
Thanks.

00:17:15.860 --> 00:17:17.690
Cheers!

00:17:21.700 --> 00:17:23.860
Stop it, Ma!
You're so embarrassing.

00:17:23.930 --> 00:17:28.450
It's a happy occasion!
You dance, too!

00:17:42.760 --> 00:17:45.410
Before we wrap up,

00:17:45.600 --> 00:17:49.260
Godai, the groom, would like
to say a few words.

00:17:58.340 --> 00:18:01.570
Thank you very much
for being here today.

00:18:02.480 --> 00:18:06.740
I'm now a certified
preschool teacher.

00:18:08.490 --> 00:18:11.170
It's been tough at times.

00:18:13.060 --> 00:18:18.880
But since my school days,
whenever I was sad or miserable..

00:18:19.690 --> 00:18:29.000
you all kept me going by
scolding or encouraging me.

00:18:29.960 --> 00:18:35.150
I may still need
your guidance and support,

00:18:36.850 --> 00:18:39.700
but with Kyoko..

00:18:43.180 --> 00:18:48.440
--my wife--we will live
our lives to the fullest.

00:18:53.650 --> 00:18:55.050
Thank you very much.

00:19:06.580 --> 00:19:08.160
That breeze feels great.

00:19:08.280 --> 00:19:10.200
It's just what we need
after all that alcohol.

00:19:10.280 --> 00:19:13.340
This formal getup is
cramping up my shoulders.

00:19:14.350 --> 00:19:17.340
I thought you booked
a hotel room?

00:19:20.090 --> 00:19:22.170
Our honeymoon doesn't start
until tomorrow afternoon.

00:19:22.260 --> 00:19:24.350
So we thought we'd spend
the night at Maison Ikkoku.

00:19:24.650 --> 00:19:25.780
Good idea.

00:19:25.850 --> 00:19:29.550
How about we wind down
with a drink, Grandma?

00:19:29.690 --> 00:19:31.180
Sounds great

00:19:31.270 --> 00:19:33.620
Now that that's decided-

00:19:33.800 --> 00:19:35.230
Let's go home!

00:19:38.100 --> 00:19:39.600
We're home, Soichiro!

00:19:39.780 --> 00:19:40.830
We're home!

00:19:41.280 --> 00:19:42.240
We're home!

00:20:02.460 --> 00:20:04.990
And time just flew...

00:20:09.200 --> 00:20:10.330
Good morning, Missus.

00:20:10.740 --> 00:20:11.920
Good morning.

00:20:12.580 --> 00:20:13.900
Have you become accustomed
to this place?

00:20:14.170 --> 00:20:15.860
I guess I adapt quickly.

00:20:16.200 --> 00:20:17.360
Especially...

00:20:18.780 --> 00:20:21.960
with my husband
by my side.

00:20:22.750 --> 00:20:24.770
Maiden name. Kozue Nanao.

00:20:24.910 --> 00:20:26.280
Currently residing in Nagoya.

00:20:26.450 --> 00:20:27.710
Happily married.

00:20:33.190 --> 00:20:36.920
Shun and Asuna Mitaka
welcomed twin girls,

00:20:37.890 --> 00:20:39.410
with a third child
on the way.

00:20:43.100 --> 00:20:44.300
Wanna go on a group date?

00:20:44.700 --> 00:20:46.300
We might meet a cool guy.

00:20:47.100 --> 00:20:48.090
Pass.

00:20:48.980 --> 00:20:51.930
Ibuki Yagami, currently attending
a women's college.

00:20:53.750 --> 00:20:56.100
What? You got a boyfriend already?

00:20:57.710 --> 00:21:01.520
Yagami's still a high-school
girl at heart.

00:21:01.610 --> 00:21:02.600
What do you mean?

00:21:03.950 --> 00:21:05.290
Mr. Godai.

00:21:07.030 --> 00:21:09.520
I can't graduate
from you yet.

00:21:10.660 --> 00:21:13.790
I'm so...admirable.

00:21:14.500 --> 00:21:15.330
Come on!

00:21:16.600 --> 00:21:17.960
Please marry me.

00:21:19.010 --> 00:21:21.460
I thought you had
a wife, Master.

00:21:21.900 --> 00:21:23.360
We were separated
for many years,

00:21:23.440 --> 00:21:25.370
and now we're
legally divorced.

00:21:26.440 --> 00:21:27.130
Oh.

00:21:27.640 --> 00:21:33.400
Akemi Roppongi. Currently
living above Chachamaru.

00:21:35.830 --> 00:21:39.590
And another cherry blossom
season has arrived.

00:21:41.190 --> 00:21:41.850
Hey!

00:21:41.920 --> 00:21:43.110
Welcome.

00:21:43.690 --> 00:21:45.450
Here. This is
for you from Master.

00:21:45.540 --> 00:21:47.360
Nice gift.

00:21:47.840 --> 00:21:50.240
Manager's coming home from
the hospital today, isn't she?

00:21:50.430 --> 00:21:52.860
She should be back
any time now.

00:21:53.170 --> 00:21:56.340
So what are those two
going to do now?

00:21:56.510 --> 00:21:59.530
They said they'd move out
when they have a kid, but.

00:21:59.640 --> 00:22:01.310
Looks like they're
here to stay.

00:22:01.370 --> 00:22:03.070
It's okay.

00:22:17.770 --> 00:22:18.560
We're home.

00:22:19.130 --> 00:22:20.800
Welcome back, Manager.

00:22:21.770 --> 00:22:23.260
Let me see your baby!

00:22:24.400 --> 00:22:26.270
What a great complexion.

00:22:26.340 --> 00:22:28.190
She's healthy like her Papa.

00:22:29.370 --> 00:22:31.240
A girl! Did you name her yet?

00:22:31.870 --> 00:22:33.570
Haruka, which means
"the fragrance of spring."

00:22:33.820 --> 00:22:37.610
Haruka? What a great name.

00:22:42.090 --> 00:22:45.200
Haruka, we're home.

00:22:47.230 --> 00:22:48.410
This is where...

00:22:53.860 --> 00:22:57.380
...your papa and mama
first met.

00:23:05.320 --> 00:23:08.980
I'm Yusaku Godai!
I live in Room Five!

00:23:09.750 --> 00:23:13.930
Nice to meet you.
My name is Kyoko Otonashi

00:23:14.020 --> 00:23:16.250
I'll be the manager of
this building from today.

00:23:37.100 --> 00:23:44.130
THE END
